 sot_rank_gap,team,metrics.sot_rank_gap.label,"Rank-space deserved-vs-actual gap: actual_rank - deserved_rank, where actual_rank = league_rank and deserved_rank = the team's rank by sot_difference within its league-season. Positive = under-performing (table position below where the on-target process deserves); negative = over-performing. Rank-derived, not an aggregate of match legs. Null when the league-season is not fully rankable.",,,,false,integer,,,,neutral,"Deserved-vs-actual gap - actual minus deserved rank; positive = results lag the process (due a correction), negative = results flatter it (regression risk). A narrative, not good or bad"
